  "description": "The world's most comfortable step-through bicycles just got more comfortable.\nFeaturing super high-volume balloon tires with a rounded contact surface, the Biria Easy Boarding Balloon-7 has all the cushion and shock absorption of a cruiser without the rolling resistance. The balloon tires on this model reduce the vibrations to the back and lumbar areas by around 25%. At the same time, due to the shape of the balloon tires, they roll more easily than standard tires. The balloon tires inflated to a tire pressure of 25-30 psi will perform like a full suspension bike, but without the complexity and extra weight of a full suspension bike. In other words, comfort AND efficiency in five colors.\nHeight recommendations:\n5'1\" to 5'6\" = 40 cm\n5'7\" to 5'11\" = 46 cm",
